      "text": "[9:05AM] #LekkiAjahAxis\n#TrafficUpdate\nTraffic movement from Ajah towards Northwest, Ikota, Chevron upto Igbo efon is good.\n\nConnecting Jakande is a bit slow due some failed sections of the road and flash flood after the downpour.\nJakande inward Chisco, Ikate upto Marwa is better.\n\nThe entire stretch on the return journey from Marwa back to Ajah is good.\n#FollowLASTMA",
